msgid " - Append frames by dragging and dropping image or cursor files from Explorer."
msgstr " - 通过从资源管理器拖放图像或光标文件来追加帧。"

#!
msgid " - Click on an item with left mouse button to select it. Hold down CTRL or SHIFT to select multiple items."
msgstr " - 使用鼠标左键单击项目以选择它。按住CTRL或SHIFT选择多个项目。"

#!
msgid " - Display context menu by right-clicking on an item."
msgstr " - 右键单击项目显示上下文菜单。"

#!
msgid " - Duplicate frames by dragging them with CTRL key pressed."
msgstr " - 按住CTRL键拖动帧来复制它们。"

#!
msgid " - Left mouse button activates the current edit tool. SHIFT and CTRL keys modify behavior of some tools."
msgstr " - 鼠标左键激活当前编辑工具。SHIFT和CTRL键修改某些工具的行为。"

#!
msgid " - Move selected frames by dragging them with left mouse button."
msgstr " - 使用鼠标左键拖动选定的帧来移动它们。"

#!
msgid " - Select multiple frames by drawing rectangle around them or CTRL- or SHIFT-clicking them. (Some operations can be run on all selected frames.)"
msgstr " - 通过在帧周围绘制矩形或按住CTRL或SHIFT单击它们来选择多个帧。（某些操作可以在所有选定帧上运行。）"

#!
msgid " - To get more help for an item, move mouse over it and read the hint in status bar (the hint is not always available)."
msgstr " - 要获取项目的更多帮助，请将鼠标移到项目上并阅读状态栏中的提示（提示并不总是可用）。"

#!
msgid " - Use right mouse button to perform mouse gestures. Right-click for context menu."
msgstr " - 使用鼠标右键执行鼠标手势。右键单击显示上下文菜单。"

#!
msgid " - Zoom in and out by rotating mouse wheel. Pan by dragging with middle button (wheel) pressed. CTRL = smooth zoom."
msgstr " - 通过旋转鼠标滚轮进行缩放。按住中键（滚轮）拖动进行平移。CTRL = 平滑缩放。"

