#!
msgid "A method used when the selected area is magnified. Color of each destination pixel is obtained using cubic interpolation of surrouding source pixels."
msgstr "选区放大时使用的方法。每个目标像素的颜色通过周围源像素的三次插值获得。"

#!
msgid "A method used when the selected area is resized. Color of each destination pixel is taken from the closest source pixel."
msgstr "选区调整大小时使用的方法。每个目标像素的颜色取自最近的源像素。"

#!
msgid "A method used when the selected area is resized. Color of each destination pixel is the average color of the covered source pixels."
msgstr "选区调整大小时使用的方法。每个目标像素的颜色是覆盖源像素的平均色。"

#!
msgid "A mouse cursor is an image moving on the computer display showing you the mouse position. The point in the image used for clicking is called \"hot spot\". Mouse cursors may be animated."
msgstr "鼠标光标是在计算机显示器上移动的图像，向您显示鼠标位置。图像中用于点击的点称为“热点”。鼠标光标可以是动画的。"

#!
msgid "A rectangle can be mapped onto a Bézier patch."
msgstr "矩形可以映射到 Bezier 曲面片上。"

#!
msgid "A rectangle can be moved, scaled in X and Y directions and rotated."
msgstr "矩形可以移动、在 X 和 Y 方向上缩放并旋转。"

#!
msgid "A rectangle can be turn into arbitrary convex quadrangle as if it were rotated in 3D space and projected back using perspective projection."
msgstr "矩形可以转换为任意凸四边形，就像在三维空间中旋转后通过透视投影投影回来一样。"

#!
msgid "A rentangle representing the viewport of the view with the given ID will be displayed and can be dragged."
msgstr "表示具有给定 ID 的视图视口的矩形将显示并可拖动。"

